// the 1910, 1986 and 2061 perihelia (77 312 samples; worst 0.95e-4 AU). Rows every 512 days, more where
// they are needed. Built by test/gmtmodules/_halley_table.jl. Outside 1900-2100 there is no position.
//
// Columns: epoch (JD, TDB), a (AU), e, I, Omega, omega, M (deg).
